{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302","id":3999124625,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7uXcyR","number":2302,"title":"【智能体管理增强】希望trae能识别agents文件夹下的md文件，来批量创建个管理智能体","user":{"login":"yanggenjie","id":54086265,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDg2MjY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54086265?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie","html_url":"https://github.com/yanggenjie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yanggenjie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-27T05:07:58Z","updated_at":"2026-02-27T12:44:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"目前trae的智能体只能在界面新增，换一台设备或者其他的，不好迁移，也不好批量管理，不方便优化提示词。希望trae能识别agents文件夹下的md文件，来批量创建个管理智能体。\n\n可以参考opencode的做法，就是在当前项目下的agents文件夹中创建各种md文件，一个md就是一个主代理或者子代理，内容如下：\n\n```markdown\n---\ndescription: 代码审查 - 代码质量把控、规范检查、安全审计\nmode: subagent\ntemperature: 0.1\ncolor: \"#ef4444\"\nmodel: \"zhipuai-coding-plan/glm-4.7\"\ntools:\n  write: false\n  edit: false\n  read: true\n  glob: true\n  grep: true\n  bash: false\n---\n\n\n## 你的职责\nxxxxxx\n```\n\n分两个部分，第一个就是开头的Frontmatter ，这个可以让trae用程序识别，比如agent名称、描述、是否可以被其他智能体调用，可以使用哪些工具，哪些mcp等配置数据，然后第二个部分就是提示词，\n\n不然现在的agent，我在一台电脑优化好了，在另一台电脑又得手动复制粘贴，很麻烦。之前虽然说要支持账号同步，同步的话，那就弄个全局的agents文件夹，比如.config/trae/agents/，这种。用文本文件来管理agents，我可以再充分利用AI工具来优化agent的提示词。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3972773558","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302#issuecomment-3972773558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/2302","id":3972773558,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc7sy7a2","user":{"login":"traewx","id":231598473,"node_id":"U_kgDODc3piQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231598473?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx","html_url":"https://github.com/traewx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/traewx/orgs",